            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="label">Ownership Entity Change</td><td class="num">$250</td><td>Prepare and send new PMA, prepare and send year-to-date financials for the old entity, send the new PMA to the utility companies, and enter the new entity information into our system.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Key Recovery</td><td class="num">Labor + materials</td><td>We require a working set of keys to all properties we manage. If you turn over a property without a working key, we contact the current resident (by mail, phone, or stopping by), obtain their key, make copies, and return the original. Billed at maintenance labor rates + material costs.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Notice Posting</td><td class="num">Labor rate</td><td>Time spent posting any physical notice (such as a Cure-Or-Quit or Entry Notice) is billed at our maintenance labor rate. Exception: no charge to post 3-day or 30-day notices to vacate.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">New Unit Pre-Signature Inspection</td><td class="num">$300</td><td>Assess new property condition, identify necessary repairs, provide cost estimates, and prepare for management. Fee credited toward onboarding if the Property Management Agreement is signed.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Oversee Property/Casualty Insurance Claim</td><td class="num">$1,250</td><td>We act as your administrator/advocate to handle an insurance claim from damage to your property, including documentation, adjusters, contractors, and insurance agents, start to finish. The 15% project management fee is waived for insurance claim work if you hire us to manage it.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Property Photography</td><td class="num">$300</td><td>Flat-rate professional photography for new vacant properties coming under management and properties that have undergone turns with major cosmetic updates, such as paint, flooring, etc. No charge for photos taken after move-out, before move-in, and for property listings.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Owner Property Visit</td><td class="num">Labor rate</td><td>We can arrange for someone to meet you or your representative at the property for a special trip (walkthrough, appraisal, etc.). Cost of posting an entry notice and visiting is billed at our maintenance labor rate. Alternatively, arrange key pickup at our office at no charge.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Delinquent Tenant Setup Fee</td><td class="num">$300</td><td>If we take over management of an occupied unit with a delinquent tenant (tenant owes more than $300), an additional setup fee applies.</td></tr>
