              <tr><td class="label">Early Termination Fee</td><td class="num">$450 / $250 per unit</td><td>If the Owner terminates the PMA prior to expiration for any reason (including sale, switching management companies, or self-managing): $450 per unit within the first year of management; $250 per unit if terminated after renewal and mid-term.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Appraisal-to-Sale Fee</td><td class="num">$300 / unit</td><td>If an appraisal or valuation is completed by our team and the property is subsequently sold, this fee is charged to account for administrative time and coordination related to the transaction.</td></tr>
