              <tr><td class="label">Failure to Provide Possession</td><td class="num">3 months' rent</td><td>Should you fail to provide possession of a unit (for any reason) to our company at least 14 calendar days prior to an executed lease term start date, a fee equal to 3 months of the executed lease rent amount applies, some or all of which is used to negotiate a mutual release between Tenant, Owner, and Broker as needed. This fee does not limit your other liability under the PMA.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Failure to Provide Evidence of Additionally Insured</td><td class="num">$20 / unit / month</td><td>Should you fail to provide evidence that you've added us as "additionally insured" to your rental dwelling policy or homeowner's insurance policy (as required by item B9 in the PMA).</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="label">Annual Technology & Accounting Fee</td><td class="num">$125 / business entity</td><td>Covers increased technology costs and annual account and tax reporting requirements. This fee ensures we can continue providing accurate and timely financial reporting and account administration.</td></tr>
